{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9b46d67535ce870b7444e32c36cca3bb7c1feadbfb565a96b48b53925a86a0f", "ja": "VR（仮想現実）ゲームを満喫するジュリア\nと琴葉。瑞希、翼、星梨花も別のタイトルを\nプレイ中。レッスンへ向かうためログアウト\nしようとした瞬間、画面にノイズが走り、見\n知らぬフィールドへと飛ばされてしまった。", "zh": "尽情享受VR（虚拟现实）游戏的茱莉亚\n与琴叶。瑞希、翼、星梨花也正在玩\n别的游戏。正当准备登出游戏去参加\n练习的瞬间，画面出现噪点，被传送\n到了陌生的原野之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "da870e96ac70adcb16dad1d5104d49185126ad00245b5836bf14d8ed5b1263a5", "ja": "―とある剣と魔法のVR世界　森林フィールド―", "zh": "——某个剑与魔法的VR世界　森林区域——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1001_enemy", "source_sha256": "d243c6a700fbd89d7732fc5521602c3be302d886f498485bc75d523e917101fb", "ja": "グルルル……グアアーッ！", "zh": "咕噜噜……嗷啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "67048e48414286ef45696a7c6003c2e55e05ffcdb33b3a18ccf12625ded6b95f", "ja": "うわっ、ちょ待……いてっ、痛てててて！\nこのエネミー、メチャクチャ強くないか！？", "zh": "哇啊，等等……好痛，痛痛痛痛痛！\n这个敌人是不是强得离谱啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "03e690152d5f206ca9649a11fa472ee200b98017e0fa864c5d20e358ecc23797", "ja": "落ち着いて、ゲームだから痛くないでしょ？\n相手の動きに合わせて、スキルを使ってみて。", "zh": "冷静点，这只是游戏，不会真的痛吧？试着配合对手的行动使用技能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "94ebc5078851087104461ae7e3cf9059129dcc746bac80b697b57ce192728a1e", "ja": "そんな、いきなり言われても……くっ！\nこうか！？　おりゃーーっ！", "zh": "突然这么说，我也没法立刻……唔！\n是这样吗！？喝啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "fec99ae6e61aa6bc015aea6fb76f806fb6428d5a7e2b11d126496c93863f376b", "ja": "おめでとう、ジュリアちゃん！\nこれでレベルアップだね。", "zh": "恭喜你，茱莉亚！\n这样就升级了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "ef6253a800bed6d2f1140038c4f90131c1aa8d8d5840e96c4f8ec0a084fcd330", "ja": "へへっ、サンキュ！　しかし、やっぱムズいな～。\nわかってるつもりでも、攻撃されると焦るっつーか。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢！不过，果然还是挺难的啊～  \n明明以为自己已经明白了，可一受到攻击就会慌，怎么说呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3a8d8e4b396225ba8fbde7a8d89582c20b810d92f97aafde76b8c455b2f8982", "ja": "それじゃ、戦闘スタイルを変えてみる？\n弓とかなら、そこまで攻撃されないかも。", "zh": "那么，要不要试着改变一下战斗风格？\n用弓之类的武器，说不定就不会被攻击得那么频繁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "085318d5a4595b862c74a5bf0333ef0ff62b117fc77b732856ac75a09ad04142", "ja": "ん～……いや、やめとく。一度決めた生き方を\n簡単に変えるなんてロックじゃない！……だろ？", "zh": "嗯～……还是算了。轻易改变自己决定好的人生方式，可不摇滚！……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "170951a38b47d37f5308ae2b0ddc0a2350aaf79e1752d88fe9c56c1305c3b94b", "ja": "ふふっ、生き方なんて、大げさな気もするけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，说什么活法，总觉得有点太夸张了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "8ca27b334d57114315b8b9e983d4d6f9524cea2b1da520d09f159064972c2a12", "ja": "しかしマジですごいな、このゲーム！\n見た目も完全に変わってるし。……アバター、だっけ？", "zh": "不过这游戏真的很厉害啊！\n外观也完全变了。……叫“虚拟形象”，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "fdc16c3848e49fba32782de36a9cdc0efafcada83d681f1180b80d8c7fb98953", "ja": "うん、カッコよくていいと思うよ。\n黒髪のジュリアちゃん、新鮮かも♪", "zh": "嗯，我觉得这样很帅，很不错。黑发的茱莉亚，感觉也挺新鲜的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "e66b78befa514127458eefc61767f89919cd1458c9a1fc3643b9901df027954e", "ja": "へへっ、そっちもな。\n琴葉はどうしてそういうアバターにしたんだ？", "zh": "嘿嘿，你那边也挺帅的。\n琴叶，你为什么会选那种头像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "8e0959a97d50902e85e28c448251c526c635bc4796217a66332facde9c6cd55d", "ja": "私はフェンシングやってるから、それに合わせて。\nそれに……。", "zh": "因为我在练击剑，所以就配合这个来选了。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1014_enemy", "source_sha256": "f2982ce9ace4bb20bf461fb76c2eee5a22dabfd90d19747e170b6e85aca6427c", "ja": "ガアアアアアァーッ！", "zh": "嘎啊啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "e58e8c4f7293544b62a19166838d6c6f71c0883c9393e1f6c20b27d834847003", "ja": "うわっ、まだいたのかよ！！\n琴葉、危な……！", "zh": "哇，居然还有吗！！\n琴叶，危……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ba2f902e9336bc6224b70f513d72b88b8a4a11c6f2fac32a80de0ffeb2058b1", "ja": "やっ、はぁっ！", "zh": "呀，哈啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1017_se", "source_sha256": "cbf4a084046b3338d428cf3b2122f63a0e774bf3adf5d35301df67774df24f11", "ja": "ズバッ！　ザシュッ！", "zh": "唰！嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1018_enemy", "source_sha256": "478d14726d71745b6a91c80d93e6e2957e1df92b198d71d921c5988fba44faf4", "ja": "キャーン！", "zh": "锵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "067e2b70e6958e9fcb2ba7fb929a81fe4fee78b9ada6fef54b687712472c21d9", "ja": "強っ！　瞬殺かよ！？", "zh": "好强！直接秒杀了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "e7ff1ac173b218aae4ffed2bb9db1b024b972aecdf47572b295d3b8d195744ee", "ja": "……それに、騎士って格好いいなと思って。\nお芝居とは、やっぱりちょっとは違うね。", "zh": "……而且，我也觉得骑士很帅气。\n不过跟演戏比起来，果然还是有些不一样的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "7096914ed4c04c0b8429fd3e5cbb84d6528d7efdcee23b804bcf95b37a305863", "ja": "しかも平然としてるし……。\nさては琴葉、意外とゲームうまいんだろ？", "zh": "而且还一副若无其事的样子……  \n琴叶，你该不会意外地很擅长游戏吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "ee817ef62c63f4d93605e80f587bde83b7e88373cccbb671dfb4f3312d2d34fe", "ja": "そ、そんなことないよ！　これはたまたまで……あ、\nもうログアウトしないと。はい、レッスンの時間です！", "zh": "才、才不是那样！这只是碰巧……啊，我得登出了。好了，练习时间到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "b395f3ff93802db4332e920eec0c0a01931e31d9efa45d552ade2ad69f9876bb", "ja": "っと、やっぱ琴葉は琴葉だな。じゃあミズキたちにも\n声掛けて……あれ、このゲームじゃないんだっけか？", "zh": "呃，果然琴叶还是琴叶啊。那我也去叫上瑞希她们……咦，不是在这个游戏里来着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "cc8ad5dce77d095cdc798dc909b8f2aa3ebbfbbcf9eace450f614753ebb5d8bd", "ja": "うん、別のゲームにログインするって言ってたよ。\nたしか『ガンゲイル・オンライン』？っていう……。", "zh": "嗯，她说要登录另一个游戏。\n好像叫《Gun Gale Online》……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1025_null", "source_sha256": "5be9b6703d7d5440a6351ec07d026ae710cfc6643671f92d961f81b34ee088a6", "ja": "―とある銃のVR世界　射撃練習場―", "zh": "——某款枪械VR世界 射击练习场——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1026_se", "source_sha256": "017de9c53222f02b5b2320a68b0b692ec1fe0c7ebdb053f7645652d39f2d8a0a", "ja": "ガン、ガン、ガーンッ！", "zh": "砰、砰、砰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "fdd6688169ede75382eeed52c1d13374bb603f2e37d8a2e3367a29ed5ddcbaa2", "ja": "わぁ、当たった、当たりました！\n見ててくれましたか？　瑞希さん！", "zh": "哇，中了，打中了！\n你刚才看到了吗？瑞希小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "6df6d21b6b7ecefd7426426e9f521818afb2d5f0ab3adce425330c40b540849c", "ja": "はい。お見事です、箱崎さん。\nこの調子なら、チーム対抗戦での優勝はいただきです。", "zh": "是的。表现得非常精彩，箱崎小姐。\n照这个势头，团队对抗赛的冠军就是我们的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6d928ebc4091f402fe8abff4a62c6544ea4d60d8a2bd5cf78551248718449345", "ja": "う～、銃の反対側が胸にあたって構えにくい～。\nせっかくアバターでバストアップできたのに～！", "zh": "呜～，枪的另一头会顶到胸口，很难摆好姿势～。\n好不容易用虚拟形象把胸部调大了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "dab98cbc3cb09acf1cb42cfa42e17c56d8b18e5bd079dc11f295218df662831b", "ja": "……不思議です。私はアバターでもいつも通り……。\nこれが意識の高さの差でしょうか。……しゅん。", "zh": "……好奇怪。我的虚拟形象和平时一模一样……\n这就是觉悟高低的差距吗。……消沉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "252940c2fd47fa97e347f4bb2d086a40654cc1d1f02025c58e8ebfdee8d6c73f", "ja": "えへへ、もしかしたら、最初ALO？っていう\nゲームでアバター作ったせいかもですね～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，说不定是因为最初在一款叫作ALO？的游戏里创建了头像吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "5337e030047259da7f72b824d02bce2654c9bb1770b040bd0fc967cd37480ae1", "ja": "わたしも普通ですけど……。でも、瑞希さんと一緒に\n遊ぶためのコンバート、上手にできてよかったです♪", "zh": "我也很普通啦，不过……能顺利完成和瑞希一起玩的转换，真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7c4788c5863abbcba4fa8a322c5f5f230a94499498183ea6c12b973b037abd2c", "ja": "でも、わたしが銃をうまく撃てないままだと、\nチーム対抗戦で勝てないかも？", "zh": "可是，如果我还是没法好好开枪的话，说不定就赢不了团队对抗赛了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "d407e5090cafa3728065d095859a39d22ccb2c6b5180b27a2ef19bfab6e526fe", "ja": "では伊吹さん、こちらを使ってみてください。\nサブマシンガンです。腰に構えて撃ちます。", "zh": "那么伊吹小姐，请试试用这个。\n这是冲锋枪，要抵在腰间射击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1035_null", "source_sha256": "a1a4c68454d2108d221c944ad1b5f5b5803ee1e7ab4f861df324a90c61eb92f7", "ja": "パラララララララララッ！", "zh": "哒哒哒哒哒哒哒哒哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "862179d26a519423b6988c9ec2888eb8515ef276504f2d1daca60bb2e844d259", "ja": "あっ、これ使いやすい♪　じゃあ瑞希ちゃん、\nこれ、困ったときに借りてもいい？", "zh": "啊，这个用起来很顺手♪ 那么，瑞希，\n我遇到困难的时候，可以借来用用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "19e95aa4475b438d7f76dfb0a0ef8bc3ea1521997c0e9d8e3e9ffd15dd9ef657", "ja": "もちろんです。近距離戦では特に役に立つかと。\n……いくぞ、最前線。", "zh": "当然可以。在近距离战斗中应该特别有用。\n……上吧，最前线。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "61b3d8640c62427df48a75a7ff3fd931eb34ef7bb09cce88617ad67bcee1f09b", "ja": "あっ！　瑞希さん、翼さん、大変ですよ。\nそろそろレッスンの時間です！", "zh": "啊！瑞希小姐、翼小姐，不好了。\n差不多到练习的时间了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dccc0a2bdb3a234e5e28fa99632d1a242bc223d2ba7ca11d72d1a983a8242787", "ja": "えーっ、もうそんな時間？\nまだ冒険とか全然できてないのに～。", "zh": "诶——已经到这个时间了吗？\n明明还完全没来得及冒险呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "24a33ab8130744c615562ddfdc6afd8999e843b7ff8e80f3afbe31126c028a40", "ja": "それはまた次回ということで。このゲームの世界は、\nどうも本当に広いようです。焦らず楽しみましょう。", "zh": "那就留到下次吧。这个游戏的世界，似乎真的很广阔。别着急，慢慢享受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f41b38027c4a8b10d2d0bbf0699176618bebaffc1b88942629e52a35b5b46b82", "ja": "はーい。じゃあ今日は帰りまーす。\nじゃあみんなで、ログアウト、っと。", "zh": "好——。那今天就先回去了。\n那么，大家一起登出吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0222_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_01_1042_se", "source_sha256": "817a80e7bac9ef05f3b5ffb42fccd9adc53009b932bdc0a6a1a3c098a3eaa23c", "ja": "ブイン……！", "zh": "呜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
